WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.719 --> 00:00:13.040
We have many days here at Film Courage where
we feel like giving up.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:14.040
We imagine you’ve had days like this also.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.600
[Filmmaker Kiowa Winana speaking] “You look
down both sides of the tunnel and you’re

00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:16.869
right in the middle.

00:00:16.869 --> 00:00:18.650
You have to make a decision.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:23.119
Do we stop here and start walking backwards
or do we just keep going?”

00:00:23.119 --> 00:00:24.789
[Actor Steve Tom speaking] “She’s just
been at it.

00:00:24.789 --> 00:00:31.380
I remember the long conversation we had on
the telephone on why this business was terrible,

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:38.470
there is no opportunity for advancement for
her and nothing was working and she just felt

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:40.210
like she was on a hamster wheel

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:41.340
going nowhere.”

00:00:41.340 --> 00:00:41.840
 

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.620
[Filmmaker Mike Hedge speaking] “Sometimes

00:00:43.620 --> 00:00:44.620
it is best to just…

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:48.050
just..call it

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:49.050
and...

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:49.550
and do something else.”

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:50.050
 

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:50.550
 

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:51.050
 

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:52.879
[Actor John Nicholson speaking] “Whenever
I think about this

00:00:52.879 --> 00:00:53.379
business is just t

00:00:53.379 --> 00:00:53.879
too hard

00:00:53.879 --> 00:00:54.379
or

00:00:54.379 --> 00:00:54.879
I want

00:00:54.879 --> 00:00:55.379
to quit

00:00:55.379 --> 00:00:55.879
or maybe

00:00:55.879 --> 00:00:56.379
I

00:00:56.379 --> 00:00:56.879
should

00:00:56.879 --> 00:00:57.379
 

00:00:57.379 --> 00:00:57.879
 

00:00:57.879 --> 00:00:58.379
 

00:00:58.379 --> 00:00:58.879
give it up…”]

00:00:58.879 --> 00:00:59.379
 

00:00:59.379 --> 00:01:00.833
Maybe one of our videos helped you on one of those days?

00:01:00.833 --> 00:01:03.560
Other than the views and comments this channel
receives, it’s hard to feel the real impact we are having.

00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:04.940
In that spirit, we are launching this video
contest.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.117
Tell us which one of our videos is your favorite
and the impact it has had on you.

